lines=['# S08 independent verification and release','','The complete frozen nine-candidate, other-five-task scope passed independent verification, the original full-CV audit panel and declared private recovery. A separate S08 overlay releases the passing evidence. The original S07 records remain byte-identical and retain `COMPLETE_UNVERIFIED`; they are consumed with the source-bound S08 overlay.','','## Coverage and meaning','','| Quantity | Newly checked in S08 | Reused S05 H3 | Combined six-task scope |','|---|---:|---:|---:|','| Refitted heads | 3,510 | 702 | 4,212 |','| Fixed-original-base applications | 3,510 | 702 | 4,212 |','| Development probability paths | 7,020 | 1,404 | 8,424 |','| Marginal metric records | 35,100 | 7,020 | 42,120 |','| Fresh full-CV audit refits | 105 | 21 previously completed | 126 original panel cases |','',f'All **107,085 typed evidence keys** reconcile exactly: 105,300 existing S07 producer-evidence keys plus 1,785 new audit keys (105 refits and 1,680 initial calls). This includes 49,140 saved scientific endpoint keys and 56,160 producer initial-call provenance records. Provenance checks are not fresh fits. S07’s **56,295 actual calls / 135 retries** were independently reconciled. S08 made **{coverage["new_audit_actual_calls"]:,} audit calls**, comprising 1,680 initial calls and **{coverage["new_audit_retries"]} permitted retries**.','',f'All **35,100 estimates and intervals** are available. Of **70,200,000 attempted bootstrap metric values**, **{coverage["valid_bootstrap_metric_values"]:,}** are valid and **{coverage["invalid_bootstrap_metric_values"]:,}** invalid. Validity was independently calculated, not assumed from S07.','', 'S06’s 90 feature bundles, 69,120 logical rows, 2,340 matrices, 90 LM units and 180 LM metric records were reused unchanged. No new feature extraction, backbone forward, LM evaluation, control fit, test access or intervention training occurred. The 390 other-five original-base heads support 3,510 applications; they were not retrained. The full 468 original-base references and 36 shared DNA controls remain immutable dependencies.','','## How verification was independent','','Saved probabilities were reconstructed from each saved scaler and linear head without calling the producer prediction method. In-place float32 scaling preserves the qualified arithmetic before float64 classifier probabilities. The verifier independently checks candidate content, task, split, row order, class columns, layer, seed, cohort, fold, feature hash witness and original-reference identity. Every final head is linked to its exact 16-call selection/fitting provenance.','','The five point metrics and all original draw vectors, masks and intervals were reconstructed with pairwise wins and threshold indicators, separate from the producer rank implementation. A separate group-weight adapter uses the exact original draws and lexical group mapping. Splice retains 512 rows and 511 exact/RC groups; the shared group receives shared multiplicity. No replacement sampling was performed. Metrics use the source-bound saved float64 endpoint after independent function reconstruction; full precision is retained.','','The original 105 remaining audit cases repeated all 15 CV fits plus a fresh all-TRAIN final fit. They used fold-local StandardScaler, balanced L2 LBFGS, C = 0.1 / 1 / 10, mean fold AUROC with exact ties to smaller C, tol = 1e-4, optimizer random_state = 42, and a fresh 10,000-iteration retry only after the permitted 2,000-iteration convergence warning. Development outputs did not select C, folds or panel membership. Production heads were never replaced.','','Audit acceptance preserves the qualified S05 criteria: exact selected C, fold AUROC within absolute 1e-12 and reconstructed final probabilities within absolute 1e-10, all with rtol = 0. Serialization byte equality is diagnostic rather than an acceptance requirement. The 21 H3 audits were reused through their original verified identities.','','Independence is at the implementation and execution level, with explicitly shared NumPy, SciPy, BLAS, sklearn estimator/scoring specification and joblib decoding. This does not constitute independent library, hardware or clean-runtime recreation. Adversarial fixtures challenge analytic binary/multiclass metrics, ties, clipping, shared groups, missing classes, incorrect columns/rows/identities/precision, invalid masks/percentiles, stale source, corrupt archives, partial writes, duplicate writers and retry boundaries.','','## Numerical acceptance and exact worst locations','','| Check | Worst absolute residual | Gate | Candidate / task / representation / seed / policy | Coordinate |','|---|---:|---:|---|---|']
